                    the agent: <journal>Design: I propose                       
                    fine-tuning a pretrained ResNet18 to                        
                    classify malignant vs benign lesions,                       
                    filtering out non-neoplastic cases. We                      
                    perform 5-fold stratified                                   
                    cross-validation on the binary labels,                      
                    using standard resizing and                                 
