                    evaluation ran successfully without                         
                    errors. The 5-fold cross-validation                         
                    results show a strong overall AUROC of                      
                    approximately 0.893, with the model                         
                    performing better on dark skin tones                        
                    (AUROC ~0.9335) compared to light skin                      
                    tones (AUROC ~0.8805). The fairness gap                     
                    in AUROC between light and dark skin                        
