                    script ran successfully without errors.                     
                    The model achieved a good overall AUROC                     
                    of approximately 0.8973 with a small                        
                    gap in AUROC between light and dark                         
                    skin tones (about 0.0159), indicating                       
                    fair performance across skin tones. The                     
                    final model was saved properly for                          
